e":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":681,"closed_issues":22796,"state":"open","created_at":"2018-01-18T16:52:20Z","updated_at":"2026-03-11T09:12:24Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":1,"created_at":"2017-08-22T14:36:05Z","updated_at":"2021-07-18T16:06:04Z","closed_at":"2021-06-17T18:04:13Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!--\r\nPLEASE HELP US PROCESS GITHUB ISSUES FASTER BY PROVIDING THE FOLLOWING INFORMATION.\r\n\r\nISSUES MISSING IMPORTANT INFORMATION MAY BE CLOSED WITHOUT INVESTIGATION.\r\n-->\r\n\r\n## I'm submitting a...\r\n<!-- Check one of the following options with \"x\" -->\r\n<pre><code>\r\n[ ] Regression (a behavior that used to work and stopped working in a new release)\r\n[x] Bug report  <!-- Please search GitHub for a similar issue or PR before submitting -->\r\n[ ] Feature request\r\n[ ] Documentation issue or request\r\n[ ] Support request => Please do not submit support request here, instead see https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/master/CONTRIBUTING.md#question\r\n</code></pre>\r\n\r\n## Current behavior\r\nDestroy listeners that are registered on `PlatformRef` and `NgModuleRef` with `onDestroy` aren't called on test bed teardown.\r\n\r\n## Expected behavior\r\nIt's expected that destroy listeners will be called automatically.\r\n\r\n## Minimal reproduction of the problem with instructions\r\nA [plunk](http://plnkr.co/edit/kYwrjgnTa7QGwLDGjQcO?p=preview):\r\n\r\n```\r\n@NgModule()\r\nexport class FooModule {\r\n  constructor(moduleRef: NgModuleRef, platformRef: PlatformRef) {\r\n    moduleRef.onDestroy(() => { throw 'module destroy' });\r\n    platformRef.onDestroy(() => { throw 'platform destroy' });\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n\r\ndescribe('tests', () => {\r\n  beforeEach(() => {\r\n    TestBed.resetTestEnvironment(); \r\n    TestBed.initTestEnvironment(\r\n      BrowserDynamicTestingModule,\r\n      platformBrowserDynamicTesting()\r\n    );\r\n  });\r\n\r\n  beforeEach(() => {\r\n    TestBed.configureTestingModule({ imports: [FooModule] });\r\n  });\r\n \r\n  it('test', inject([], () => {\r\n    expect(1).toBe(1)\r\n  });\r\n});\r\n```\r\n\r\n## What is the motivation / use case for changing the behavior?\r\n\r\nModules can have cleanup code that should be executed in order for them to function correctly in environments with multiple bootstraps (which TestBed tests are).\r\n\r\n## Environment\r\n\r\n<pre><code>\r\nAngular version: 4.3.5\r\n<!-- Check whether this is still an issue in the most recent Angular version -->\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"dylhunn","id":7135246,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxMzUyNDY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7135246?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn","html_url":"https://github.com/dylhunn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dylhunn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/18831/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/angular/angular/issues/18831/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"c